 take a left.

497
00:20:15.981 --> 00:20:17.748
 COSBY: What's the matter with you?

498
00:20:17.749 --> 00:20:20.117
 You should be
 ashamed of yourself.

499
00:20:20.118 --> 00:20:21.485
 Kicking in the doors

500
00:20:21.486 --> 00:20:23.988
 with the big boots
 and the guns.

501
00:20:23.989 --> 00:20:26.690
 Damn, Rummy. I'm sick
 of playing with y'all.

502
00:20:26.691 --> 00:20:28.492
 Y'all two are pathetic.
 [COSBY MUMBLING]

503
00:20:28.493 --> 00:20:31.062
 Hey, in Iraq we was in
 Special Ops.

504
00:20:31.063 --> 00:20:33.864
Y'all niggas should have been
 in the Special Olympics.

505
00:20:33.865 --> 00:20:35.166
 I'm goin' home.

506
00:20:35.167 --> 00:20:38.702
 Oh, come on, man. Look,
 we'll kidnap Bill Cosby.

507
00:20:38.703 --> 00:20:40.071
 It'll still be fun.

508
00:20:40.072 --> 00:20:42.005
 Yeah, man, it's only 4:00.

509
00:20:42.006 --> 00:20:44.175
 Come on. We can write
 the ransom note together.

510
00:20:44.176 --> 00:20:47.345
 I don't think so, guys.
 I gotta get home for dinner.

511
00:20:47.346 --> 00:20:49.513
RILEY: Later. COSBY: ...
with their parents...

512
00:20:49.514 --> 00:20:51.181
 Don't listen to him,
 he's just a hater.

513
00:20:51.182 --> 00:20:52.582
 You a good planner.

514
00:20:52.583 --> 00:20:56.286
<i>Look, you about to
 kidnap Bill Cosby.</i>

515
00:20:56.287 --> 00:20:57.988
 How many motherfuckers
 can say

516
00:20:57.989 --> 00:21:00.157
 that they did some shit
 like that, huh?

517
00:21:00.158 --> 00:21:03.260
 You gotta start lookin'
 at the bright side.

518
00:21:03.261 --> 00:21:05.729
 Yeah. Sure
 you're right.

519
00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:07.631
 I am a pretty good
 planner, huh?

520
00:21:07.632 --> 00:21:09.699
 RILEY:
 And y'all niggas are gay.

521
00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:12.536
 COSBY:
 -To the wall. I...

522
00:21:12.537 --> 00:21:14.705
 You know, I just-
 Oh, no.

523
00:21:14.706 --> 00:21:17.541
 Man. This- This reminds me
 of when I...

524
00:21:17.542 --> 00:21:20.178
<i>HUEY: Ed and Rummy
kidnapped Bill Cosby.</i>

525
00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:23.914
 [COSBY MUMBLING]

526
00:21:23.915 --> 00:21:25.315
<i>But he was really annoying,</i>

527
00:21:25.316 --> 00:21:27.518
<i>so they returned him
 to the studio 15 minutes later.</i>

528
00:21:27.519 --> 00:21:29.953
 COSBY: I'm upset with you
for comin' in here...

529
00:21:29.954 --> 00:21:33.390
<i>HUEY: As usual, nobody even
thought about stopping them.</i>

530
00:21:33.391 --> 00:21:35.092
 What the fuck
 y'all lookin' at?

531
00:21:35.093 --> 00:21:38.562
<i>Riley had gotten away,
 but returned</i>

532
00:21:38.563 --> 00:21:40.464
<i>several hours later
 when he realized</i>

533
00:21:40.465 --> 00:21:42.900
<i>he had dropped
 his two-way pager.</i>

534
00:21:46.571 --> 00:21:48.772
 Okay, okay, okay.

535
00:21:48.773 --> 00:21:51.809
 Let me explain.

536
00:21:51.810 --> 00:21:53.911
You must have lost your mind!
 Ow! Oh! Ow!

537
00:21:53.912 --> 00:21:55.646
You do not-
Hey, man! Just let me- Ow!

538
00:21:55.647 --> 00:21:57.648
 -kidnap Oprah!

539
00:21:57.649 --> 00:21:59.450
 [?]

540
00:22:04.355 --> 00:22:06.291
 [?]